  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who are familiar with internet meme culture, particularly those who recognize and use the Shiba Inu meme format. The meme is designed to appeal to users who understand the visual trope of the Shiba Inu conveying smugness or indifference, and who may be engaging with or sharing content that trivializes transphobia by framing it as a personal preference rather than a harmful bias. The audience likely includes online communities that consume and circulate memes with ironic or dismissive tones, and may be drawn to the meme’s provocative and controversial nature. The meme’s use of the Shiba Inu as a dehumanizing symbol and its hateful trope are intended to resonate with audiences who either endorse or are indifferent to transphobic attitudes, or who enjoy mocking serious social issues through humor or satire.",
